    <div><b>800</b><span>support tickets / day</span></div>
    <div><b>2</b><span>people answering them</span></div>
    <div><b>11h</b><span>to first reply</span></div>
  </div>
  <p class="lead" data-step="2">“Let's just add AI.”</p>
</section>

